  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response to Pakistan Floods 2022 - Nutrition and Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is an emergency response package following extensive flooding in Pakistan in 2022. It includes lifesaving nutrition services and livelihoods support, with a focus on the most affected, including women and children. It is delivered by the United Nations Children&apos;s Fund and CARE International in Pakistan, with support provided from 2023 to 2024. It is the second phase of Australia&#x2019;s emergency assistance to the 2022 floods in Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
